# System user for the SKey uinput helper.  The server runs as this user
# instead of root; /dev/uinput access is granted via the udev ACL rule
# (99-skey-uinput.rules), never via group membership in "input" — that
# would let the server read every /dev/input/event* device.
u @SKEY_UINPUT_USER@ - "SKey uinput server"
